        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 4,
          "text": "(lower compression tennis ball with slower bounce)"
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 5,
          "text": "WHERE TO PLAY"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 6,
          "text": "Your local tennis court, a pickleball court, a brewery, a parking lot, your driveway—the opportunities to play Red Ball are endless. Just pop up a net on any hard surface and get playing!"
